comment_text:
@carwow @mat The YT algorithm brought me here today... a year too late, but I would have felt exactly the same way a year ago: Do I like Tesla? Not really. Do I like BYD? See Tesla. Do I like electric cars? See Tesla. Do I like Mat Watson? See... er, just kidding. ;-) 
@3:32 But when I see how you open the door on the Tesla, I wonder if you also use your right arm to signal your intention to turn left when you're riding a bike.

Who on earth opens a car on the left side with their right arm??? It looks so ridiculously wrong!

And whether you close the door by the handle is another question entirely—I actually quite like the idea (better than greasy fingerprints on the window or something).

All the best
